# Build provenance (RFP Section 4): every project-specific file in this repo was
# written from scratch for this build. Nothing is copied from a prior project and
# nothing predates the first commit. Prepared before kickoff: only a generic
# Python environment (venv + openai/anthropic/python-dotenv) and the public RFP.
# The commit history is the record. See README.md "Build provenance".
#
# Audio (RFP Section 6.3): the only audio file, samples/intake_sample.mp3, is
# machine-generated macOS `say` text-to-speech. No music, no hold-music beds, no
# jingle, no sound libraries without rights (none used at all), no cloned voices,
# no real client recording. See samples/README.md.

.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
out/

